 "remarks": "Discover modern elegance and upscale downtown living at The Classic, one of Stamford's premier luxury high-rise residences. This beautifully remodeled 1BR/1BA condominium offers sophisticated finishes, exceptional amenities, and an unbeatable location. A beautifully appointed lobby and doorman service welcome you into this distinguished residence. Inside, the sun-filled unit showcases brand-new designer flooring, crown molding, and an open-concept living and dining area that flows seamlessly onto a private balcony. The stunning redesigned kitchen features quartz countertops, gray shaker cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, stylish tile backsplash, gas cooking, and breakfast bar seating. The spacious primary bedroom offers direct balcony access and a generous walk-in closet, while the updated bathroom features a modern vanity and tub/shower combination. Enjoy resort-style amenities including a rooftop indoor pool, fitness center, resident lounge, rooftop terrace with sweeping city views, and outdoor dog park with grilling areas. Additional conveniences include in-unit laundry, garage parking, and gas cooking and hot water included in the common charges. Perfectly positioned in the heart of downtown Stamford, just moments from acclaimed restaurants, shopping, nightlife, theaters, parks, and Metro-North. Luxury, lifestyle, and location all in one exceptional offering!",
